#. module: aic_send
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_aic_send
msgid ""
"\n"
"Core Share on WhatsApp\n"
"=======================\n"
"A \"WhatsApp\" button in the chatter of every record. It opens a short sheet with the contact's number (in\n"
"international form) and a message written for the document (quotation, order, invoice, purchase order or any\n"
"record), including a secure customer-portal link when the record has one. \"Open WhatsApp\" opens WhatsApp Web or\n"
"the app with the message filled in; the share is logged on the record, and a draft quotation is marked as sent,\n"
"the same as sending it by email.\n"
"\n"
"Works on Community and Enterprise and needs no WhatsApp Business account. Can be turned off in Settings.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: aic_send
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:aic_send.res_config_settings_view_form_aic_send
msgid ""
"A WhatsApp button in the chatter of every record: the contact's number, a "
"ready message and, for quotations, invoices and purchase orders, a secure "
"link to the document. Reload the page after changing."
msgstr ""
"Un bouton WhatsApp dans la discussion de chaque enregistrement : le numéro "
"du contact, un message prêt et, pour les devis, factures et bons de "
"commande, un lien sécurisé vers le document. Rechargez la page après "
"modification."

